{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a2defef0e8b0d50c6293ed0aa437076ecabce5030c5dd7b2269d259acd075bc0", "ja": "（春香達3人によるユニットは大反響だった。\nおかげで、さっそく次の仕事も舞い込んできたぞ！）", "zh": "（由春香她们3人组成的组合大受欢迎。多亏了这个，马上又有新的工作找上门来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "b8f8991ae90d6876bb429106b997aaa3740891d39de179ed7843391939be25db", "ja": "えーと、そしたら……まず、あっちを終わらせて……。\nうう、本当に終わるかなぁ……。", "zh": "那个……那么，首先把那边的事情做完……\n呜呜，真的能做完吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aca37a9aa14d12407fa5ffa86c1484759a2c78c59de4f66bb707fdf3339889bf", "ja": "お、ちょうどいいところに！\n春香、今、ちょっといいかな？", "zh": "哦，来得正好！\n春香，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "5b6c4ba70b89640fc8605e78ce646ea936e6d817de4c19617f4e7624d471cbcb", "ja": "大丈夫かなぁ……って、あっ、お疲れさまです！\n{$P$}さん、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "我正想着是不是没事呢……啊，辛苦了！{$P$}先生，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8c4104e8ded7876fe41e776ed0a9b0d6a3613353742633b726850d5e70d05c10", "ja": "ああ、実はな……。\n春香達のユニットに新しい仕事の依頼が来たんだ！", "zh": "啊，其实是这样的……\n春香她们的组合接到了新的工作委托！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "009a72f4b620ac3a853f57d7331d43d13048cda09e822916d890a47f2c2646ed", "ja": "わぁ、本当ですか！？\nやりましたねっ、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？\n太好了，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a7d349453bfeea77bc3dd7b3424f699badee58494925e1bbc0ab6b4fb7ccfe69", "ja": "ああ、これも3人が頑張ってくれたおかげだよ。\nそうだな、ご褒美に……みんなでBBQでもしようか！", "zh": "啊，这也是多亏了这3人的努力啊。\n对了，就当作奖励……大家一起去吃烧烤怎么样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "f534b64c112936d7b79905274f2fb9bb90cde9509a4989b3d36dbc9480715147", "ja": "わーい、大賛成です♪\nふふっ、やよいと響ちゃんもきっと喜ぶだろうなぁ。", "zh": "哇——我举双手赞成♪\n呵呵，弥生和响也一定会很高兴的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f2ec4e63b9902881392d618733994289202e17576d16777ac1b96bb4936c44b1", "ja": "それで、いつにしますか！？　そうだ、ちょうど\nBBQで試してみたいお菓子が……って、あっ！", "zh": "那我们定在什么时候！？对了，正好有种想在烧烤会上试试的点心……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "d4618e41caacedd079c90fa4af35a3e76bdeb1ed7ddb43c9ea293a8d300ee448", "ja": "ううぅ……忘れてたぁ……。えっと、すみません。\n私、参加できないかもしれません……。", "zh": "呜呜……我给忘了……那个，对不起。\n我可能，没法参加了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1011_p", "source_sha256": "69bdee6a8cbe357e29dd1e20439cdb57e7fdc5e11f3e513799dd42aeb1f324f0", "ja": "ん？　どういうことだ？", "zh": "嗯？这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "05644d6e57b49031fa1e439ae8084bd6f8ceb4f8f72eab4342328b7c9cdbded5", "ja": "実は、その……。\nな、夏休みの宿題が……終わってなくて。", "zh": "其实，那个……\n暑、暑假作业……还没写完。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cbe2ca8c80784bda2d6e050a4e57eedd0afd7a94dbcf25f1395ab993a7140bbd", "ja": "へっ……？　宿題？\nあれ、たしか前に、宿題はもう終わってるって。", "zh": "咦……？作业？\n奇怪，我记得你之前说过作业已经做完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "84e521a8b559258aebd1a9b7b1bfc9d77d2726d663056715e9fe5ac7ee58b2ec", "ja": "言いましたっ！　言いましたけど、でも……\nやった教科と範囲と提出日が全部ズレてたんです……。", "zh": "我说过！是说过没错，可是……做的科目、范围和提交日期全都对不上……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ca0ac4b605835a9ec57123c83bf724500622922a4de9757f412afe8e3480b2a4", "ja": "ええっ！？　いったいどうしたら\nそんなアクロバティックな間違い方を……。", "zh": "诶！？究竟得怎么做，才能犯下这么离谱的错误啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "96502ed115c3f0c60ecdea48e53cd3ae0e705286fcd819204c906516809c2960", "ja": "うう、毎日こつこつ頑張ったのになぁ……。\nだから、すみません、BBQは……。", "zh": "呜，我明明每天都在一点一点地努力……所以，对不起，BBQ就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1017_p", "source_sha256": "48b4f77014bfdcc42d1a55ff2bc4a707c03f89890cbbe0ceb64299b8124c9cc1", "ja": "……よし。それなら、仕事も頑張ってもらったし、\n今回は、俺もつきあわせてもらうよ。", "zh": "……好。既然这样，工作上也承蒙你那么努力，\n这次我也奉陪到底吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "475ba4b9f48e7f441e030acc916c3de49e2dea645876c4ab53a8c88ed1c86141", "ja": "えっ、いいんですか！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "605cab6a545cc07e757469637f2936e54f07120755e3ed577eabedabae6b1e65", "ja": "ああ、やよいの宿題も手伝ってあげてくれたしな。\nでもまあ、次はちゃんと気を付けるんだぞ。", "zh": "嗯，你也帮了弥生做作业嘛。\n不过下次可要好好注意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "b32ad344d74dfaae93a9c29552c32eb6b797477d866ad901289ee65239608c6f", "ja": "はいっ！　えへへ♪\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的！嘿嘿♪\n谢谢{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0183_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "9b9bb313e5509fb62ff79d105aed17c1748e485d7ef773c2a5c271c9f45b0cbf", "ja": "よーし、ちゃんと宿題を終わらせて……、\n最高に楽しいBBQにしましょう！　おーっ！", "zh": "好——认真把作业做完……  \n然后来一场最开心的烧烤吧！哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
